    "post_decision_s": 0.092,
    "text_complete_latency_s": 0.616
   },
   {
    "seg": 2,
    "text": "She tells us that at this festive season of the year with Christmas and roast beef looming before us",
    "t_start": 15.424,
    "t_end": 22.176000000000002,
    "decided_at": 22.688,
    "emitted_at": 22.791,
    "true_start": 15.71,
    "true_end": 22.125,
    "forced": false,
    "n_partials": 11,
    "first_partial_latency_s": 0.481,
    "first_text_latency_s": 0.481,
    "final_latency_s": 0.666,
    "vad_delay_s": 0.563,
    "post_decision_s": 0.103,
    "text_complete_latency_s": 0.269
   },
   {
    "seg": 3,
    "text": "Similes drawn from eating and its results occur most readily to the mind",
    "t_start": 22.528,
    "t_end": 27.168,
    "decided_at": 27.712,
    "emitted_at": 27.892,
    "true_start": 22.8,
    "true_end": 27.095,
    "forced": false,
    "n_partials": 7,
    "first_partial_latency_s": 1.091,
    "first_text_latency_s": 1.091,
    "final_latency_s": 0.797,
    "vad_delay_s": 0.617,
    "post_decision_s": 0.18,
    "text_complete_latency_s": 0.197
   },
   {
    "seg": 4,
    "text": "He has grave doubts whether Sir Frederick Leighton's work is really Greek after all and can discover in it but little of rocky Ithaca",
    "t_start": 29.536,
    "t_end": 38.751999999999995,
    "decided_at": 39.263999999999996,
    "emitted_at": 39.396,
    "true_start": 29.81,
    "true_end": 38.685,
    "forced": false,
    "n_partials": 12,
    "first_partial_latency_s": 0.582,
    "first_text_latency_s": 0.582,
    "final_latency_s": 0.711,
    "vad_delay_s": 0.579,
    "post_decision_s": 0.132,
    "text_complete_latency_s": 0.609
   },
   {
    "seg": 5,
    "text": "Lynell's pictures are a sort of up guards on Adam paintings and Mason's exquisite idols are as national as a jingo poem",
    "t_start": 40.96,
    "t_end": 50.687999999999995,
    "decided_at": 51.199999999999996,
    "emitted_at": 51.381,
    "true_start": 41.23,
    "true_end": 50.625,
    "forced": false,
    "n_partials": 14,
    "first_partial_latency_s": 1.16,
