    "post_decision_s": 0.105,
    "text_complete_latency_s": 0.344
   },
   {
    "seg": 17,
    "text": "And remarks with pleasing courtesy and felicitous grace that many phases of feeling",
    "t_start": 141.696,
    "t_end": 148.288,
